{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "A Day in Japantown", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Time for Sushi", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Between the Market Stalls > Tokyo Fish Market", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 11, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn4le11ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Making and Responding to Requests", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you go to a restaurant, you often make requests to the waiter.<br> You use <span class=\"strong\">modals </span> to make requests:<br> <br>Can you + verb? <br/>Example: <span class=\"italic\">Can you help me?</span><br/><br/> Can I + verb? <br/>Example: <span class=\"italic\">Can I sit by the window?</span><br/><br> Could you + verb  <br/>Example: <span class=\"italic\">Could you bring me the menu, please?</span><br/><br> Could I + verb <br/>Example: <span class=\"italic\">Could I have some water, please?</span><br>  <br>The waiter uses these phrases to respond:<br><span class=\"italic\">Of course.</span><br> <span class=\"italic\">Certainly.</span><br> <span class=\"italic\">Right away.</span><br><span class=\"italic\"> Yes.</span><br> <span class=\"italic\">Very good, Miss.</span><br>", "type": "describer"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "ravenous ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "starving; very hungry ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm ravenous ... I have to eat!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le11ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use at a Japanese restaurant.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "tempura ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a Japanese dish of fish or vegetables fried in light batter ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'd like to try the shrimp tempura, please.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le11ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "teriyaki ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a Japanese dish stir-fried in a special sauce ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to try the chicken teriyaki.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le11ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "chopsticks", "type": "name"}, {"content": "two small sticks used for eating food ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I am not good at eating with chopsticks.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le11ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "set menu ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a menu with a set course of food", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Here is our set menu.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le11ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Visit a Japanese restaurant in person or online. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Try or choose new food, if you can, and write down what you eat.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "What did you like? What did you not like?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 4 sentences about your experience.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share the information with a partner. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I review a restaurant menu and talk about food.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I express my preferences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write complete statements on a food experience.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about my experience with my partner.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le11ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le11ob07re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn4le11ob07re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn4le11ob07re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hmm ... I'm ravenous! Oh, a sushi place - perfect!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: Irasshaimase! Welcome to Sushi Station! Table for one?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, thank you.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: How about right here?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Could I sit near the window, please?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: Of co